    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise beyond fortune-telling. Awaken the Oracle within.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Tarot Awakening\u2122</i>, your journey is more than reading cards, it\u2019s mastering destiny itself.\u00a0</strong>You\u2019re not just a seeker... you\u2019re the director.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Every card is a character. Every scene, a choice - Director\u2019s Mode</strong> <br>In <strong><i>Actors in a Tarot Drama</i></strong>, Step into dramatic life scenes and assign tarot cards to each character. Interpret betrayal, truth, passion, and consequence in a story-driven oracle experience.\u00a0Every card is a character. Every scene, a mystery, you are the director. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/82c2f8ac2f5cd5d01f36ca9623e85149.poster.avif?t=1752252178\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/82c2f8ac2f5cd5d01f36ca9623e85149.webm?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/82c2f8ac2f5cd5d01f36ca9623e85149.mp4?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Under the quiet pull of the moon, your journey deepens.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>the Moon Reflections room</strong></i>, log your thoughts, track your intuition, and align your inner world with the lunar cycle. Each phase offers a new prompt, an invitation to reflect, release, or renew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/fbb15fa4d8ce213d3c3785f78db16067.poster.avif?t=1752252178\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/fbb15fa4d8ce213d3c3785f78db16067.webm?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/fbb15fa4d8ce213d3c3785f78db16067.mp4?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 New Moon: What do you wish to begin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 Full Moon: What truths have been revealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf18 Waning Moon: What must you let go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other\u00a0Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Tarot Training:</strong> Master the Rider\u2013Waite deck through guided spreads, intuitive reading exercises, and real-world layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory &amp; Intuition Challenges:</strong> Sharpen your mind with memory games, flip-to-reveal challenges, and symbolic associations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oracle Rank System:</strong> Rise from Wandering Novice to Supreme Oracle, your performance shapes your title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystical Environments:</strong> Read in enchanted altars, unlock secret backgrounds, and feel the pull of sacred spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/4efa0fc0bfaf220b6fd34a46bdbeda2b.poster.avif?t=1752252178\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/4efa0fc0bfaf220b6fd34a46bdbeda2b.webm?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/4efa0fc0bfaf220b6fd34a46bdbeda2b.mp4?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Guidance:</strong> Let immersive narration and subtle ambient sounds guide your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track Your Growth:</strong> Journal your insights, victories, and transformative moments along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tarot Awakening\u2122</strong> isn\u2019t just a game *** It\u2019s a calling. <br>Unlock the wisdom of the ancients. Challenge your mind. Trust your spirit.\u00a0Inspired by the Rider\u2013Waite tradition, this is the ultimate test of your intuition and mastery. Will you ascend to Oracle status or wander the mysteries forever?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The deck awaits you!\u00a0</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <i>Note: Currently not compatible with Steam Deck. We are actively working to improve support and will update this section once Steam Deck play is verified.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise beyond fortune-telling. Awaken the Oracle within.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Tarot Awakening\u2122</i>, your journey is more than reading cards, it\u2019s mastering destiny itself.\u00a0</strong>You\u2019re not just a seeker... you\u2019re the director.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Every card is a character. Every scene, a choice - Director\u2019s Mode</strong> <br>In <strong><i>Actors in a Tarot Drama</i></strong>, Step into dramatic life scenes and assign tarot cards to each character. Interpret betrayal, truth, passion, and consequence in a story-driven oracle experience.\u00a0Every card is a character. Every scene, a mystery, you are the director. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/82c2f8ac2f5cd5d01f36ca9623e85149.poster.avif?t=1752252178\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/82c2f8ac2f5cd5d01f36ca9623e85149.webm?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/82c2f8ac2f5cd5d01f36ca9623e85149.mp4?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Under the quiet pull of the moon, your journey deepens.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>the Moon Reflections room</strong></i>, log your thoughts, track your intuition, and align your inner world with the lunar cycle. Each phase offers a new prompt, an invitation to reflect, release, or renew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/fbb15fa4d8ce213d3c3785f78db16067.poster.avif?t=1752252178\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/fbb15fa4d8ce213d3c3785f78db16067.webm?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/fbb15fa4d8ce213d3c3785f78db16067.mp4?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 New Moon: What do you wish to begin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 Full Moon: What truths have been revealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf18 Waning Moon: What must you let go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other\u00a0Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Tarot Training:</strong> Master the Rider\u2013Waite deck through guided spreads, intuitive reading exercises, and real-world layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory &amp; Intuition Challenges:</strong> Sharpen your mind with memory games, flip-to-reveal challenges, and symbolic associations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oracle Rank System:</strong> Rise from Wandering Novice to Supreme Oracle, your performance shapes your title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystical Environments:</strong> Read in enchanted altars, unlock secret backgrounds, and feel the pull of sacred spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/4efa0fc0bfaf220b6fd34a46bdbeda2b.poster.avif?t=1752252178\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/4efa0fc0bfaf220b6fd34a46bdbeda2b.webm?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711860/extras/4efa0fc0bfaf220b6fd34a46bdbeda2b.mp4?t=1752252178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Guidance:</strong> Let immersive narration and subtle ambient sounds guide your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track Your Growth:</strong> Journal your insights, victories, and transformative moments along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tarot Awakening\u2122</strong> isn\u2019t just a game *** It\u2019s a calling. <br>Unlock the wisdom of the ancients. Challenge your mind. Trust your spirit.\u00a0Inspired by the Rider\u2013Waite tradition, this is the ultimate test of your intuition and mastery. Will you ascend to Oracle status or wander the mysteries forever?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The deck awaits you!\u00a0</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <i>Note: Currently not compatible with Steam Deck. We are actively working to improve support and will update this section once Steam Deck play is verified.</i></p>",
